    "created_at": "2020-08-21T08:44:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-21T08:44:15Z",
    "body": "After migrating to a new machine when cloning the repo I found there was a file name collision due to case insensitivity. I.e a file called `Example.txt` colliding with a file called `example.txt`.\r\n\r\nOnce this was resolved, the deleted file symbol no longer appears.\r\n\r\nPerhaps there is a need to introduce an appropriate symbol for this, or perhaps it is a documentation change to explain why you see the cross when the repository state is apparently clean?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
