    "created_at": "2020-09-01T17:50:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-01T17:51:02Z",
    "body": "I believe this is going to be caused by differences from what `libgit2` and `git` consider as changes, I'm going to pop this in the `v1.0.0` milestone since we are going to be replacing the `libgit2` for performance reasons and that should resolve this.",
